VYNT Technologies is an AI-powered gaming intelligence platform that helps creators analyze, optimize, and manage gaming content. TikTok Login Kit lets creators securely sign in and connect their TikTok account to VYNT through TikTok OAuth. VYNT uses user.info.basic to identify the connected account and display permitted basic profile information. VYNT uses the Display API and video.list to retrieve permitted video information from the creator’s authorized TikTok account. This information is displayed in VYNT’s dashboard and may be used for content organization, analytics, keyword and topic analysis, AI-powered insights, and optimization recommendations. VYNT uses the Content Posting API to support creator-authorized publishing of content prepared within VYNT. TikTok access tokens and other sensitive credentials are handled server-side and are not stored in the public frontend or GitHub repository. VYNT only uses information available through approved TikTok products and scopes and does not request TikTok passwords or use unauthorized scraping or browser automation.
